{"id":"51683617fcb0f714","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-transitive-closure-set.md","title":"ZFC Transitive Closure Set","display":"df-zfc-transitive-closure-set — ZFC Transitive Closure Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-transitive-closure-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-transitive-closure-set"],"display":"df-zfc-transitive-closure-set — ZFC Transitive Closure Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-transitive-closure-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-transitive-closure-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-transitive-closure-set — ZFC Transitive Closure Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,T\\in V\">\\(x,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S\\)</span>（规范传递闭包谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClosureSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveClosureSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本原子的兼容谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}set}\\vdash \\mathrm{TransitiveClosureSet}_S(T,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S(T,x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}set}\\vdash \\mathrm{TransitiveClosureSet}_S(T,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S(T,x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>规范上游谓词把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 定义为所有含有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 且传递的集合之交，因此同时给出传递性与最小性。</li>\n<li>传递类与按序列构造传递闭包是相关但不同层级的概念，不是该兼容定义的直接前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S$（规范传递闭包谓词，见 [[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveClosureSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}set}\\vdash \\mathrm{TransitiveClosureSet}_S(T,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S(T,x)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1059,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3750","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-transitive-closure-set.md|58-df-zfc-transitive-closure-set]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","8c8abfb908cc9a24"]}